  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato into fries.\n• Place fries on the lined oven tray. Sprinkle with roast chicken sprinkle and drizzle with olive oil.\n• Toss to coat, spread out evenly and bake until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69a13d8cb83c0c3e7ed0189d/step-35fcca00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice tomato.\n• Pat haloumi dry, then slice horizontally to get 1 piece per person.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69a13d8cb83c0c3e7ed0189d/step-14662310.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with enough olive oil to coat the base.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 2 mins each side. Set aside on a paper towel-lined plate.\n• Meanwhile, halve continental rolls and bake directly on oven rack until heated through, 2-3 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69a13d8cb83c0c3e7ed0189d/step-56e19220.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spread rolls with dill & parsley mayonnaise. Top with baby spinach leaves, tomato and haloumi.\n• Serve with fries and your favourite dipping sauce.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69a13d8cb83c0c3e7ed0189d/step-163a1330.jpeg"
    }
  ]
